   "text": "The patient was admitted to the orthopedic surgery service and \nwas taken to the operating room for above described procedure.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=2675-2801",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Please see separately dictated operative report for details.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=2803-2863",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \nsurgery was uncomplicated and the patient tolerated the \nprocedure well.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=2864-2941",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Patient received perioperative IV antibiotics.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=2942-2988",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Postoperative course was remarkable for the following:",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=2990-3044",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On POD#1, the patient was given a 1L NS bolus for difficulty \nvoiding.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3046-3116",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He voided appropriately after.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3118-3148",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On POD#2, the patient had an elevated creatinine and was mildly \nhyponatremic.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3150-3228",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was monitored.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3230-3247",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On POD#3, the patient continued to have an elevated creatinine \nand hyponatremia.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3251-3332",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was given a 1L NS bolus.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3334-3361",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Repeat sodium \nimproved to 132 and creatinine to 1.6.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3363-3416",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Another 1L NS bolus was \nordered.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3418-3451",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Sodium and creatinine normalized after.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3453-3492",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Otherwise, pain was controlled with a combination of IV and oral \npain medications.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3494-3577",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient received Lovenox for DVT \nprophylaxis starting on the morning of POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3579-3662",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The foley was \nremoved and the patient was voiding independently thereafter.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3664-3740",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The surgical dressing was changed on POD#2 and the surgical \nincision was found to be clean and intact without erythema or \nabnormal drainage.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3742-3884",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s19",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was seen daily by physical \ntherapy.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3885-3933",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s20",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Labs were checked throughout the hospital course and \nrepleted accordingly.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=3934-4009",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s21",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At the time of discharge the patient was \ntolerating a regular diet and feeling well.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=4010-4095",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s22",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was \nafebrile with stable vital signs.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=4097-4147",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s23",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient's hematocrit was \nacceptable and pain was adequately controlled on an oral \nregimen.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=4149-4245",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s24",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The operative extremity was neurovascularly intact and \nthe wound was benign.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=4246-4323",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s25",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient's weight-bearing status is weight bearing as \ntolerated on the operative extremity.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17644781-DS-9:chars=4326-4421",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
